    "bbox": [
      126.14,
      109.48,
      521.72,
      125.23
    ],
    "text": "This is an appeal seeking to set aside the judgment dated 22.9.1998 ofthe learned",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      11.919297218322754
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.38,
      137.1,
      487.11,
      152.84
    ],
    "text": "District Judge ofKandy. Appellant in this appeal also sought to have a decree for divorce",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.09,
      164.92,
      514.3,
      180.66
    ],
    "text": "dissolving his marriage contracted with the defendant-respondent (hereinafter referred to as the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.09,
      192.53,
      279.93,
      208.28
    ],
    "text": "defendant) on the basis of malicious desertion.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      12.28911304473877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      125.68,
      248.45,
      522.16,
      264.2
    ],
    "text": "In the aforesaid judgment, learned District Judge decided that the plaintiff-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      54.82,
      276.28,
      525.31,
      292.03
    ],
    "text": "appellant (hereinafter referred to as the plaintiff) failed to establish \"constructive malicious",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      54.85,
      303.89,
      523.9,
      319.64
    ],
    "text": "desertion\" on the part of the defendant upon which the case of the plaintiff had been filed.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      12.422006607055664
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      54.7,
      331.97,
      385.62,
      347.71
    ],
    "text": "Accordingly, he dismissed the plaint filed by the plaintiff with costs.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      89.89,
      387.17,
      525.11,
      402.92
    ],
    "text": "The plaintiff, in paragraph 1 0 of the plaint has stated that he had to leave the matrimonial",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      12.154815673828125
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      54.46,
      415.01,
      524.86,
      430.76
    ],
    "text": "home on 25.1 0.1993 due to cruel treatment of the defendant. In evidence he has said that the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.729741096496582,
      11.800000190734863,
      12.28911304473877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      54.6,
      442.6,
      525.09,
      458.34
    ],
    "text": "defendant ill-treated him while they were living in a government quarters. He has further stated",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      54.43,
      470.68,
      521.21,
      486.43
    ],
    "text": "that the defendant even used to come to his work place and abused him in the presence of others.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      12.28911304473877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      89.74,
      525.89,
      524.63,
      541.64
    ],
    "text": "Apart from the said evidence as to the alleged ill treatment, basically it is because of the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      12.154815673828125
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      54.46,
      553.73,
      525.32,
      569.48
    ],
    "text": "non-disclosure of a child been born to the defendant before the marriage that this action had been",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      12.28911304473877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      54.6,
      581.57,
      524.78,
      597.32
    ],
    "text": "filed. Even though the said child had been introduced as a daughter of a sister of the defendant at",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      12.154815673828125,
      12.28911304473877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      54.46,
      609.64,
      524.29,
      625.39
    ],
    "text": "the time of their marriage, she had subsequently admitted that the said child was born to her.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      12.154815673828125
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      54.62,
      637.26,
      525.26,
      653.0
    ],
    "text": "The defendant in her evidence had denied that she ill-treated the plaintiff but had admitted that",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      54.44,
      666.28,
      285.35,
      682.03
    ],
    "text": "the child referred to above is a daughter of hers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      12.28911304473877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      283.54,
      31.36,
      292.32,
      46.97
    ],
    "text": "3",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      88.22,
      66.94,
      523.07,
      83.08
    ],
    "text": "The learned District Judge having considered the evidence recorded had decided that the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      52.57,
      94.05,
      522.84,
      110.2
    ],
    "text": "plaintiff failed to establish constructive malicious desertion on the part of the defendant in the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.100000381469727,
      12.444350242614746
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      52.68,
      121.65,
      522.9,
      137.79
    ],
    "text": "degree required by law and had dismissed the action accordingly. In deciding so, he has stated",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.022552490234375,
      12.100000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      52.05,
      148.29,
      76.86,
      164.43
    ],
    "text": "thus:",
    "fonts": [
